<title>USA: ICE Holdings names new president.</title>
<headline>ICE Holdings names new president.</headline>
<dateline>PLAYA DEL REY, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICE Holdings Inc said it named Gregory Martin as president after asking former president Mathew Zuckerman to resign last week.</p>
<p>Martin continued to serve as executive vice president and chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
